			"widgets_values":[
				"### 🟢 End Frame Support (Image-to-Video)  \n`Start + End Frame Interpolation Support`  \n\nThis workflow allows you to guide the motion between two images: a **start frame** and an **end frame**.\n\n🛠️ To enable:  \n🔓 Un-bypass the second `Load Image` and `Resize` nodes  \n🔗 Connect the output from the second `Resize` node to:  \n  📥 `end_image` on `Image-to-Video Encode`  \n  📥 `clip_vision` on `Clip Vision Encode`\n\n\n\n---\n"
